/com,--- Data in consistent MKS units. See Solving Units in the help system for more information.
/units,MKS
/nopr
/wb,file,start              !  signify a WB generated input file
/prep7
! Turn off shape checking because checks already performed inside WB mesher.
! See help system for more information.
SHPP,OFF,,NOWARN
/nolist
!etcon,set             ! allow ANSYS to choose best KEYOP's for 180x elements, resets any applicable keyopt to MAPDL defaults
/com,*********** Nodes for the whole assembly ***********
nblock,3,,11
(1i9,3e20.9e3)
        1     2.886751346E-01     0.000000000E+00    -5.000000000E-01
        2    -5.773502692E-01     0.000000000E+00     3.546129901E-16
        3     2.886751346E-01     0.000000000E+00     5.000000000E-01
        4     0.000000000E+00     8.164900000E-01     0.000000000E+00
        5    -1.443375673E-01     0.000000000E+00    -2.500000000E-01
        6     2.886751346E-01     0.000000000E+00    -2.842170943E-17
        7     1.443375673E-01     4.082450000E-01    -2.500000000E-01
        8    -1.443375673E-01     0.000000000E+00     2.500000000E-01
